sentences.text:
] Accordingly, the bail application under Section 439 Cr.P.C. is allowed and it is ordered that the accused-petitioner- Ganeshlal S/o Hamera shall be enlarged on bail in connection with FIR No.782/2022 registered at Police Station Pratapnagar, District Udaipur,
provided he furnishes a personal bond in the sum of Rs.50,000/- with two sureties of Rs.25,000/-
each to the satisfaction of the learned trial Judge for his appearance before the court concerned on all the dates of hearing as and when called upon to so.

